{"id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:covering-homotopy-property","title":"prop:covering-homotopy-property","path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.md","line":471,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.tex#prop:covering-homotopy-property","uses":["[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:covering-space]]","[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:lift-of-a-map]]","[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#thm:fundamental-group-of-circle]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.tex","label":"prop:covering-homotopy-property","line":748,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[Homotopy lifting property]\n\\label{prop:covering-homotopy-property}\n\n\\uses{def:covering-space, def:lift-of-a-map, thm:fundamental-group-of-circle}\n\n\\dcref{ch1:1.30}\n\\group{Covering Spaces}\n\nFor a covering $p:\\widetilde X\\to X$, a homotopy $f_t:Y\\to X$, and a lift\n$\\widetilde f_0$ of $f_0$, there is a unique lifted homotopy\n$\\widetilde f_t:Y\\to\\widetilde X$. In particular, paths and homotopies of\npaths lift uniquely after an initial lift is chosen.\n\\end{proposition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[Homotopy lifting property] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a636f766572696e672d686f6d6f746f70792d70726f7065727479\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter1%23def%3Acovering-space\">↗ def:covering-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter1%23def%3Alift-of-a-map\">↗ def:lift-of-a-map</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter1%23thm%3Afundamental-group-of-circle\">↗ thm:fundamental-group-of-circle</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch1:1.30</span></span>\\group Covering Spaces <p></p>For a covering <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p:\\widetilde X\\to X$\">$p:\\widetilde X\\to X$</span>, a homotopy <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f_t:Y\\to X$\">$f_t:Y\\to X$</span>, and a lift <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\widetilde f_0$\">$\\widetilde f_0$</span> of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f_0$\">$f_0$</span>, there is a unique lifted homotopy <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\widetilde f_t:Y\\to \\widetilde X$\">$\\widetilde f_t:Y\\to \\widetilde X$</span>. In particular, paths and homotopies of paths lift uniquely after an initial lift is chosen. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:lift-of-a-map","next":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:covering-map-pi1-injective","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:covering-space","title":"def:covering-space","label":"def:covering-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:lift-of-a-map","title":"def:lift-of-a-map","label":"def:lift-of-a-map"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#thm:fundamental-group-of-circle","title":"thm:fundamental-group-of-circle","label":"thm:fundamental-group-of-circle"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:covering-map-pi1-injective","title":"prop:covering-map-pi1-injective","label":"prop:covering-map-pi1-injective"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:covering-lifting-criterion","title":"prop:covering-lifting-criterion","label":"prop:covering-lifting-criterion"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#lem:covering-space-of-graph-is-graph","title":"lem:covering-space-of-graph-is-graph","label":"lem:covering-space-of-graph-is-graph"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:covering-homotopy-property","title":"prop:covering-homotopy-property","tex":"\\begin{proposition}[Homotopy lifting property]\n\\label{prop:covering-homotopy-property}\n\n\\uses{def:covering-space, def:lift-of-a-map, thm:fundamental-group-of-circle}\n\n\\dcref{ch1:1.30}\n\\group{Covering Spaces}\n\nFor a covering $p:\\widetilde X\\to X$, a homotopy $f_t:Y\\to X$, and a lift\n$\\widetilde f_0$ of $f_0$, there is a unique lifted homotopy\n$\\widetilde f_t:Y\\to\\widetilde X$. In particular, paths and homotopies of\npaths lift uniquely after an initial lift is chosen.\n\\end{proposition}","source":"tex/references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:covering-space","title":"def:covering-space","description":""},{"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#def:lift-of-a-map","title":"def:lift-of-a-map","description":""},{"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#thm:fundamental-group-of-circle","title":"thm:fundamental-group-of-circle","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}